; Written by Frank Vest; Last modified April 9, 1985L X ResetL X Do-itL X Ld MEMA		; load memAll diagnosticL C0 Addr R0;		This code is stolen from "showS.midas"L C1 Addr SVA		; current virtual address for storageL C2 Addr COL		; current cache columnL C3 Addr SEXPECTEDL C4 Addr ;	leave it blankL C5 Addr RSCRL C6 Addr RSCR2L C7 Addr T 20;	End code stolen from "showS.midas"L C8 Addr ROW 0L C12 Addr ITERATIONSL C13 Addr MEMFLAGSL C14 Addr FLAGSL C15 Addr ROW 1L B0 Addr SPATX;		Begin more code stolen from "showS.midas"L B1 Addr CURSPATTERNL B2 Addr SVAXL B3 Addr SVAHIXL B4 Addr SMAXBRHIL B5 Addr SNMODULESL B6 Addr SSUBRSCRL B7 Addr SVAHIOLDL B8 Addr SVAXOLDL B9 Addr SIMSCR0		; SIM TASK SCRATCH REGISTERL B10 Addr SIMSCR1	; SIM TASK SCRATCH REGISTERL B11 Addr SMCRVICTIML B11 Addr HOLDL B12 Addr PIPE 0L B15 Addr PIPE 10L A19 Addr TASK 20	; use task 0 as defaultL A19 Val 0L A7 Addr RBASE 20	; use rbase 17 as defaultL A7 Val 17L A17 Addr PROCSRN	; init procsrn to zeroL A17 Val 0L X DisplayOn		; memA.midas  August 13, 1979  6:44 PML X UnBrk SVATRYNEXTPATL X TimeOut 40000000; 120 min, for 12 megaword memory systems.L X Go BEGINL X Skip 1L X ShowError MemA Timed out